  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Personalised education for displaced young people</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Displaced young people (15-24) living in Athens face considerable challenges to attending public school. Better Days&apos; award-winning flagship project, Gekko, offers personalised, trauma-aware education for young people to pursue quality education in a dignified space. We recognize that the uncertainty of displacement poses significant barriers to learning. Our experienced educators work one-on-one with students to set clear goals and develop step-by-step plans for achieving their dreams.</narrative>
  </description>
